des backtick/CR/LF pattern check; forward mode --branch validation uses only a basic format check. Symmetric hardening is the stated style for flag validation in this file.\\\",\\\"impact\\\":\\\"Low practical risk (branch names with CR/LF are rejected by git); however the inconsistency is a latent surface if the flag is ever composed in a CI template without shell quoting.\\\",\\\"mitigation\\\":\\\"Add the same backtick/CR/LF guard to forward-mode --branch validation to match restore mode.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"R4-CORR-006\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"nit\\\",\\\"claim\\\":\\\"tests/scaffolder/test_scaffold_downstream.sh validates YAML syntax via import yaml inside a Python here-doc. If pyyaml is absent the test emits ModuleNotFoundError with no context, and the CI failure message does not identify which assertion failed.\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"tests/scaffolder/test_scaffold_downstream.sh lines 110-117: python3 - \\\\\\\"$outdir/.github/workflows/policy-check-wrapper.yml\\\\\\\" <<'PY' / import yaml / yaml.safe_load(...) / PY — no ImportError guard, no descriptive exit message.\\\",\\\"impact\\\":\\\"Cosmetic: CI failure is harder to triage on environments without pyyaml. Low severity.\\\",\\\"mitigation\\\":\\\"Add try: import yaml; except ImportError: sys.exit('SKIP: pyyaml not installed — install it to run YAML lint checks') before the load call, or add pyyaml to the test dependency pre-check at the top of the script.\\\"}]}\\n```\",\"stop_reason\":\"end_turn\",\"session_id\":\"7e471e36-97e4-402a-9808-43287b0d799c\",\"total_cost_usd\":1.74138395,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":11,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":182705,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":370965,\"output_tokens\":47671,\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":182705,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"inference_geo\":\"\",\"iterations\":[{\"input_tokens\":3,\"output_tokens\":4570,\"cache_read_input_tok